        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-ATL100012SWVSBR, Austrian Crystal Bling Glass Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pair (2 door pulls) of First Impressions Bling glass door pulls are filled with sparkling Austrian crystals and fitted with detailed filigree end brackets adding outstanding harmony to the design.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omn-mortise-entrance-handleset.jpg?v=1704354592\" width=\"500\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" alt=\"FII-SD-ATL02012 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back-to-Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a glass door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL02012-specifications.gif?v=1704354708\" width=\"408\" height=\"207\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\"  alt=\"Austrian Crystals Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest materials including ultra clear acrylic that allows the Austrian Crystals to show their shimmering beauty. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions 12 Inch Atlantic Austrian Crystal Shower Pull Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Acrylic filled with Austrian Crystals</li>\r\n<li>Filigree Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL02012-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>First Impressions ATL100012SWVSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
