                "title": "12 Inch Atlantic Austrian Crystal Shower Pull",
                "description": "First Impressions SD-ATL100012SWVSBR, 12 Inch Decorative Austrian Crystal Glass Door Pulls - The 12 Inch Decorative Austrian Crystal Glass Door Pulls are filled with sparkling Austrian Crystals these very decorative glass door pulls are fitted with detailed filigree end brackets adding outstanding harmony to the design. Made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest materials including ultra clear acrylic that allows the Austrian Crystals to show their shimmering beauty.",
